        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "It's better than sittin' up in a crack den with the MAC-11",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Yellin' at your fiends and friends to duck",
          "rhyme": "yk",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "There's feds at the door! Oh, it's just Fed Ex",
          "rhyme": "Eks",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I thought I heard walkie-talkies, must've been them redneck",
          "rhyme": "Ek",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Neighbors of mine - they fuckin with they CB",
          "rhyme": "9b",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "And we in the spot, watchin' COPS on TV",
