          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Drinkin' OE, hopin' pigs don't see",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "If they were psychic, they'd try to give him the electric chair",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "It's gettin' hectic in here and it's a election year",
